Dear Karen,

=20

I am following up on my earlier email.

=20

I would be grateful if you could please send this to the judge urgently.=20

=20

I am unable to prepare my application to appeal the judgement because I do =
not have any funds for legal representation.

=20

I would like to file my corrections for the draft and prepare the applicati=
on to appeal but I cannot do this without legal counsel at it is very techni=
cal.

=20

I also need to apply urgently for a Non-Molestation Order and for enforceme=
nt of the MPS order.

=20

I cannot speak with the respondent, and I will not communicate with him. Ev=
en when I don=E2=80=99t have any money.

=20

I need legal counsel to assist me with the judgement, the appeal of the jud=
gement, the Non-Molestation order and the MPS.

=20

Without legal counsel, I will not have a fair and equitable trial. I need l=
egal counsel to draft the application for the appeal and I definitely intend=
 to appeal the judgement.

=20

I would be grateful for your guidance with this matter.

=20

Sincerely,

=20

Nadia Zahmoul

